#, python-format
msgid ""
"A new Mercado Libre order (%(order_id)s) arrived for this pack, but was not "
"automatically added: this sale was adopted from another system, so its "
"commercial details are left untouched. Review manually whether/how to add "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Llegó un nuevo pedido de Mercado Libre (%(order_id)s) para este pack, pero "
"no se agregó automáticamente: esta venta fue adoptada de otro sistema, así "
"que sus detalles comerciales se dejan sin tocar. Revisar manualmente si/cómo"
" agregarlo."

#. module: xe_meli_connector
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:xe_meli_connector.field_meli_invoice_document__meli_linked_pack_id
msgid ""
"A pack id known for this document by some other means than the tiers "
"_compute_sale_order_id already tries on its own — the main real case "
"(2026-09-14) is an order adopted from Ventiapp: its sale.order only ever "
"knows its own pack_id (reference/client_order_ref/meli_pack_id), never this "
"document's own real meli_order_id, so none of the existing tiers can bridge "
"the two. Deliberately source-agnostic: filled today via the Order-to-Pack "
"Excel mapping wizard, but nothing here assumes that — a future automatic "
"lookup (e.g. fetching the order's own pack_id straight from Mercado Libre) "
"can populate it the exact same way."
msgstr ""
"Un pack ID conocido para este documento por algún otro medio distinto a los "
"niveles que _compute_sale_order_id ya intenta por sí solo — el caso real "
"principal (2026-09-14) es un pedido adoptado de Ventiapp: su venta solo "
"conoce su propio pack_id, nunca el meli_order_id real de este documento. Se "
"llena hoy vía el asistente de mapeo Excel Pedido-a-Pack, pero nada aquí "
"asume eso — una futura búsqueda automática puede llenarlo de la misma forma."

