msgstr "Historial de comunicación del sitio web"

#. module: xe_meli_connector
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:xe_meli_connector.field_account_bank_statement_line__meli_invoice_document_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:xe_meli_connector.field_account_move__meli_invoice_document_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:xe_meli_connector.field_account_payment__meli_invoice_document_id
msgid ""
"Which Mercado Libre document (meli.invoice.document) is currently related to this invoice/credit note. Mercado Libre is the only source of the CFDI for this move — Odoo never stamps it through its own PAC (blocked by res.partner.cfdi_issued_by_third_party, see xe_l10n_mx_edi). Used to detect refacturación: when a newer meli.invoice.document exists for the same order with a different id than this field points to, the invoice gets cancelled and replaced.\n"
"\n"
"index=True (2026-09-14): without a DB index on this FK column, deleting rows from meli.invoice.document forces Postgres to sequentially scan the whole account_move table to enforce referential integrity — confirmed in practice (a ~5000-row DELETE took 10+ minutes before this fix, vs. seconds after adding the equivalent index by hand)."
msgstr ""
"Qué documento de Mercado Libre (meli.invoice.document) está actualmente "
"relacionado con esta factura/nota de crédito. Mercado Libre es la única "
"fuente del CFDI para este movimiento — Odoo nunca lo timbra con su propio "
"PAC. Se usa para detectar refacturación: cuando existe un "
"meli.invoice.document más nuevo para el mismo pedido con un id distinto al "
"que apunta este campo, la factura se cancela y se reemplaza."

#. module: xe_meli_connector
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:xe_meli_connector.field_meli_invoice_document__xml_file
msgid "XML File"
msgstr "Archivo XML"

#. module: xe_meli_connector
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:xe_meli_connector.field_meli_invoice_document__xml_filename
msgid "XML Filename"
msgstr "Nombre de Archivo XML"

#. module: xe_meli_connector
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:xe_meli_connector.field_sale_order__meli_order_date_closed
msgid ""
"date_closed from the Mercado Libre order resource — when the order first "
"reached confirmed/paid and stock was discounted on Mercado Libre's side. "
"Compare against Created At to tell a genuinely late payment (large gap) from"
" an order that landed here for another reason."
msgstr ""
"date_closed del recurso de pedido de Mercado Libre — cuando el pedido llegó "
"por primera vez a confirmado/pagado y se descontó el inventario del lado de "
"Mercado Libre. Compararlo contra Creado el para distinguir un pago "
"genuinamente tardío de un pedido que llegó aquí por otra razón."

#. module: xe_meli_connector
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:xe_meli_connector.field_sale_order__meli_order_date_created
msgid ""
"date_created from the Mercado Libre order resource — when the order was "
"originally placed, regardless of when it was paid."
msgstr ""
"date_created del recurso de pedido de Mercado Libre — cuando el pedido se "
"realizó originalmente, sin importar cuándo se pagó."

#. module: xe_meli_connector
#: code:addons/xe_meli_connector/models/meli_invoice_document.py:0
