"Physical return confirmed to quarantine location %(location)s via "
"transfer(s) %(pickings)s."
msgstr ""
"Devolución física confirmada a la ubicación de cuarentena %(location)s vía "
"la(s) transferencia(s) %(pickings)s."

#. module: xe_meli_connector
#: code:addons/xe_meli_connector/wizards/meli_quarantine_return_wizard.py:0
